            "heading": "OUR STORY",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "16618951072671241e-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Bleusalt is a seasonless line of elevated luxury basics made in the USA from the softest fibers on Earth. Bleusalt is a female-founded luxury lifestyle brand born in Malibu and built on the principles of sustainability, elevated comfort and timeless design. Founded by Lyndie Benson, a photographer, creative director and mother of two, Bleusalt emerged from a vision to create consciously-made wardrobe essentials that feel as beautiful as they look.</p><p>Every Bleusalt piece is handmade in the USA, working closely with local Los Angeles partners in cut-and-sew production and fulfillment to ensure ethical craftsmanship and exceptional quality at every step. Our famously soft fabric is developed specially for Bleusalt from TENCEL™ fibers sustainably derived from tree fibers, creating a luxuriously soft and breathable material that embodies the ease of Malibu living.</p><p>Loved by icons including Meghan Markle, Cindy Crawford, Kaia Gerber and Patrick Dempsey, Bleusalt has become a symbol of relaxed elegance with timeless pieces that elevate daily life and make people feel their best.</p><p>With a Malibu heart and a global reach, Bleusalt continues to grow through curated capsule collections that bring the feeling of coastal Malibu luxury to the world.<br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
