            "heading": "ABOUT LYNDIE BENSON",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_rrgNWE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>After dedicating nearly three decades to building a life and legacy alongside her former husband—supporting his rise while raising their two sons—Lyndie Benson found herself starting over at age 50. With no roadmap, but a lifetime of experience, creativity, and resilience, she began again—this time on her own terms. What followed was a bold reinvention: the launch of a luxury lifestyle brand rooted in sustainability, style, and the spirit of Malibu.</p><p>A lifelong lover of the ocean and elevated living, Lyndie created Bleusalt to offer wardrobe essentials that reflect the beauty and ease of coastal life. She brings an artist’s eye to every detail, photographing and directing the brand’s campaigns while overseeing its creative and strategic direction.</p><p>As a founder, mother, and visionary, Lyndie is committed to building a legacy of independence, impact, and refinement—proof that it’s never too late to begin again and create something extraordinary.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
